Estimate $f'(2)$ from the drawn tangent, giving your answer to $2$ decimal places. The labelled points lie on the tangent.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}
\draw[->] (0,0)--(4,0) node[right] {$x$};
\draw[->] (0,0)--(0,7) node[above] {$f$};
\draw[blue,thick,domain=0.7:3.3,samples=60] plot (\x,{0.5*(\x-2)^2-(5/3)*(\x-2)+4});
\draw[orange,thick] (0.8,6)--(3.2,2);
\fill (2,4) circle (2pt) node[right] {$P(2,4)$};
\node[left] at (-0.3,6) {$(0.8,6)$};
\node[right] at (3.2,2) {$(3.2,2)$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
